# Template for .devcontainer/.env, which is gitignored and generated.
#
# `node .devcontainer/bootstrap.mjs` appends the generated block below
# whatever is in here, and re-running it replaces only that block - so
# anything you add above it survives.
#
# You should not normally need to edit either file: the app's own secrets
# (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, CLAUDE_MODEL) are read from the repo-root .env, which
# the compose file loads if it exists.
